message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article matching the part of the tool
  you used: the preferred citation below for the spatiotemporal decomposition and
  actionable statistics, or the Pattern Recognition article under references for
  the residual-motif analysis.
title: "cml_synthetic_demo: a web application to discover actionable spatiotemporal descriptors of urban dynamics from mobile-phone data"
